WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Auntie, is Qihua at home?

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,600
Let’s find Captain Qihua

3
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,260
I'm here. Come in quickly.

4
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:09,270
Captain, what do you think about going to the hotel department? I plan to go.

5
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:10,950
But my parents don't agree

6
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:12,510
They want to go to Shangyang Base

7
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:13,670
Shangyang base is so far away

8
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:14,790
Why don't you go to the hotel?

9
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:18,520
I didn’t dare to go to the captain after listening to the new name.

10
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,200
We have already made arrangements with our families

11
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,880
I'll leave for the hotel early tomorrow morning

12
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,760
If you plan to go to Shangyang Base

13
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,560
We can only report this to Yang Biao.

14
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,040
Parents, what are you doing?

15
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,440
When will you know that I have grown up?

16
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:32,980
If you can support this family alone, just wait for me.

17
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,620
I'll go talk to them again

18
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:37,300
Captain, try your best to convince your parents that in this world

19
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,580
There will never be a safer place to get to know mom and dad than a hotel

20
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,260
I know you are afraid of hotels

21
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:43,540
But we have no other choice

22
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:46,740
Haven't you tried the lunch boxes in the hotel? Isn't it delicious? Isn't the water clean enough?

23
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,020
Everything you need is available in the hotel

24
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:50,260
Trust me once, mom and dad, your son

25
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,420
He is no longer the child hiding behind you. He has grown up.

26
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:54,220
I can support this family.
